[262.304374, "o", "nohup: ignoring input\r\n=== Content read back from sandbox ===\r\nserver {\r\n    listen 8080;\r\n    server_name localhost;\r\n    location / {\r\n        root /var/www/html;\r\n        index index.html;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n=== End of content ===\r\nSandbox ID: ign51z565jei5n628r0hy\r\nJSON info written to /home/user/e2b_task_info.json\r\nSandbox is alive. Sleeping to keep it running...\r\n"]
